.TH ZDOTS-QUIZ 1 "2026-07-21" "zdots" "zdots manual"
.SH NAME
zdots-quiz \- # bin/zdots\-quiz — Probe local model capability on zdots\-specific tasks.
.SH SYNOPSIS
See OPTIONS below (generated from \fBzdots-quiz --help\fR).
.SH OPTIONS
.nf
# bin/zdots-quiz — Probe local model capability on zdots-specific tasks.
#
# Runs a curated suite of prompts against the local Qwen2.5-Coder model via
# zdots-ask and scores responses by keyword presence. Use to calibrate what
# the local model knows about zdots conventions before trusting it with real
# work, and to detect regressions after model swaps.
#
# Usage:
#   zdots-quiz              # run all cases
#   zdots-quiz --domain shell   # run only shell domain cases
#   zdots-quiz --verbose    # print model responses alongside scores
#   zdots-quiz --list       # list test case IDs
#   zdots-quiz TC-01 TC-05  # run specific cases by ID
.fi
.SH SEE ALSO
agent-guide(1), zdots-doctor(1)
